      "title": "Our Benefits",
      "description": "Our Benefits Skip to main content Close Search For You Prospective Students Full-Time Undergraduate Transferring to Rollins Professional Advancement Graduate Studies Graduate Business Executive Education Current Students Parents & Families Alumni & Supporters Employers Media Resources MyRollins Library Wellness Center Careers at Rollins Campus Map Community Events Arts & Culture Bookstore Emergency Info Sports About Rollins News Working At Rollins Who We Are Faculty Development Grants & Sponsored Research Our Benefits Our Culture Our Location Our Service Excellence Job Openings All Job Openings Staff Jobs Faculty Jobs Adjunct Jobs Student Jobs Required Notices Directions & Parking Payroll Search Toggle Menu Search Working At Rollins Back Who We Are Faculty Development Grants & Sponsored Research Our Benefits Our Culture Our Location Our Service Excellence Job Openings Back All Job Openings Staff Jobs Faculty Jobs Adjunct Jobs Student Jobs Required Notices Directions & Parking Payroll For You Back Prospective Students Full-Time Undergraduate Transferring to Rollins Professional Advancement Graduate Studies Graduate Business Executive Education Current Students Parents & Families Alumni & Supporters Employers Media Resources Back MyRollins Library Wellness Center Careers at Rollins Campus Map Community Events Arts & Culture Bookstore Emergency Info Sports About Rollins News Our Benefits Rollins offers the total package. Benefits at Rollins are more than part of the total compensation package. They are a reflection of our commitment to the well-being of our employees and their families, today, and in the years to come. Benefits Overview As a Rollins College employee, you can take advantage of benefits and opportunities that will enhance the quality of your life, provide protection for a variety of circumstances, help you prepare for your future, aid in personal and professional growth, and help you maintain balance in your work and family life. Learn more about our generous benefits. Free Tuition for Employees and their Families Retirement Matching Up to 11.5% Paid Time Off (Vacation, Sick & Personal time) Paid Holiday & Closure Days Medical, Prescription, Dental & Vision Insurance Employer-Funded Health Reimbursement Account ($125+/month) Employer-Funded Employee Assistance Program Employer-Paid Short & Long Term Disability Insurance Domestic Partner Benefits Pet Insurance Located within walking distance from the Winter Park SunRail Station and located on multiple Lynx Bus Routes Local & National Discount Programs Award-Winning Wellbeing Programs And More! Child Development Center Priority Waitlist The Alfond Inn discounts Rollins Employee Housing Program Learn more about the College-owned apartments and townhomes available to Rollins College employees! Learn More 1000 Holt Ave. Winter Park, FL 32789 Phone: 407.646.2000 Campus Map & Directions ADMISSION INFORMATION Full-Time Undergraduate Transferring to Rollins Professional Advancement Graduate Studies Graduate Business Executive Education INFORMATION FOR Faculty & Staff Current Students Alumni & Supporters Parents & Families RESOURCES Library MyRollins Registrar Campus Map Events Calendar Rollins News Emergency Info INFORMATION ABOUT Rollins Sports Giving Arts & Culture Rollins Careers Bookstore For the Media EASE Grant Performance Measures Facebook Instagram YouTube TikTok LinkedIn Privacy Policy Terms and Conditions Accessibility Statement Title IX Policies & Resources Nondiscrimination Policy © 2026 Rollins College"
