    "https://www.rollins.edu/careers/our-service-excellence/": {
      "title": "Our Service Excellence",
      "description": "Our Service Excellence Skip to main content Close Search For You Prospective Students Full-Time Undergraduate Transferring to Rollins Professional Advancement Graduate Studies Graduate Business Executive Education Current Students Parents & Families Alumni & Supporters Employers Media Resources MyRollins Library Wellness Center Careers at Rollins Campus Map Community Events Arts & Culture Bookstore Emergency Info Sports About Rollins News Working At Rollins Who We Are Faculty Development Grants & Sponsored Research Our Benefits Our Culture Our Location Our Service Excellence Job Openings All Job Openings Staff Jobs Faculty Jobs Adjunct Jobs Student Jobs Required Notices Directions & Parking Payroll Search Toggle Menu Search Working At Rollins Back Who We Are Faculty Development Grants & Sponsored Research Our Benefits Our Culture Our Location Our Service Excellence Job Openings Back All Job Openings Staff Jobs Faculty Jobs Adjunct Jobs Student Jobs Required Notices Directions & Parking Payroll For You Back Prospective Students Full-Time Undergraduate Transferring to Rollins Professional Advancement Graduate Studies Graduate Business Executive Education Current Students Parents & Families Alumni & Supporters Employers Media Resources Back MyRollins Library Wellness Center Careers at Rollins Campus Map Community Events Arts & Culture Bookstore Emergency Info Sports About Rollins News Working at Rollins Our Service Excellence At Rollins, we strive to be responsive, respectful, collaborative, competent, and inclusive in all that we do. Whether serving prospective or current students, alumni, local residents, or our fellow faculty and staff colleagues, these standards define the Rollins service experience. Learn more about our Five Service Standards below. Responsive Innovative, resourceful, and timely Approachable and open-minded Solution-oriented Personalized and caring Balancing individual and institutional needs Respectful Friendly, courteous, and considerate Exhibiting care and compassion when serving others Valuing different ideas and perspectives Treating others with dignity Collaborative Effective at communicating within and outside of our immediate work groups Working together to accomplish departmental and institutional goals Demonstrating teamwork across boundaries Supporting others in what they do Keeping our eye on the big picture Competent Thorough knowledge of job and institutional mission Effective, efficient, and reliable performance Proficient in meeting student and customer needs Ability to align our efforts with departmental and institutional goals Ongoing commitment to excellence, innovation, and continuous improvement Inclusive Valuing diverse identities of those we serve Ensuring services are accessible, equitable, and inviting Serving with cultural awareness, humility, and sensitivity Eliminating barriers and biases that may produce disparate service outcomes Ongoing commitment to excellence, innovation, and continuous improvement 1000 Holt Ave. Winter Park, FL 32789 Phone: 407.646.2000 Campus Map & Directions ADMISSION INFORMATION Full-Time Undergraduate Transferring to Rollins Professional Advancement Graduate Studies Graduate Business Executive Education INFORMATION FOR Faculty & Staff Current Students Alumni & Supporters Parents & Families RESOURCES Library MyRollins Registrar Campus Map Events Calendar Rollins News Emergency Info INFORMATION ABOUT Rollins Sports Giving Arts & Culture Rollins Careers Bookstore For the Media EASE Grant Performance Measures Facebook Instagram YouTube TikTok LinkedIn Privacy Policy Terms and Conditions Accessibility Statement Title IX Policies & Resources Nondiscrimination Policy © 2026 Rollins College"
